PAYROLL WORKFLOW:

1. Payroll admin selects month.
2. System collects approved attendance.
3. System collects approved leave.
4. System loads effective salary structures.
5. System calculates earnings.
6. System applies configured deductions.
7. System generates payroll preview.
8. Payroll admin reviews exceptions.
9. Authorized approver approves payroll.
10. System locks the approved cycle.
11. Payslips are published.
12. Employees receive notifications.
13. Payroll exports become available.

Payroll must support immutable audit history and controlled corrections.

Use precise decimal arithmetic.

Never use floating-point arithmetic for money.

